  "priorExpiration": "2011-02-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6701.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish procedures for the dissemination of information contained in the DNA database regarding samples collected pursuant to RSA 651-C and for the expungement of records contained in the DNA database.\n\nSource. #7727, INTERIM, effective 7-20-02, EXPIRES: 1-16-03; ss by #7748, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9762, INTERIM, eff 8-14-10, EXPIRED: 2-10-11\n\nNew. #9889-A, eff 3-18-11; ss by #12794, eff 5-28-19",
